    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2687" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄϊστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰδεῖν</span>) :—poet. Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unseen</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καί κέ μ᾽ ἄ. ἀπ᾽ αἰθέρος ἔμβαλε
					πόντῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.258
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεῖνον μὲν ἄ. ἐποίησαν περὶ πάν των</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.235
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴχετ᾽ ἄ., ἄπυστος</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				242
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤλετ᾽ ἄκλαυτος, ἄϊστος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					565
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμοὶ δ᾽ ἄϊστοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					811
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἀΐστοις τελέθων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					466
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτρέψειεν ἄϊστον
			ὕβριν</span> (prolept.) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				881
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἀείραο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.746
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀΐστως, θυμὸν ὄλεσσαν</span>
			<i>utterly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				3.263
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>unconscious of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτας ἐμᾶς ἄϊστος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1314
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1321
			</span></i>.</div>
